      "statement": "The fallback move is the turn's `fallback_move` (System 1's top move) when the latest turn belongs to this request and the move is in the legal pool; otherwise a random choice from the pool seeded by `<Seed>:<request fingerprint>`, or 0000 when the pool is empty.",
